[{"s":0,"a":3.2,"d":4.75,"text":"沿着一次 kubectl apply，看 Pod 如何诞生。","f":"e61c270011.mp3","h":"e61c270011","r":0},{"s":1,"a":0.6,"d":3.98,"text":"kubectl apply 就是一次 HTTPS 请求。","f":"ddd5721773.mp3","h":"ddd5721773","r":17},{"s":1,"a":4.8,"d":4.82,"text":"依次过认证、授权、准入，任一关不过就被拒。","f":"215364d197.mp3","h":"215364d197","r":0},{"s":1,"a":10.2,"d":4.8,"text":"写进 etcd 就返回成功，此时 Pod 还一个都没有。","f":"f261c1a1ac.mp3","h":"f261c1a1ac","r":0},{"s":2,"a":0.6,"d":4.32,"text":"etcd 用 Raft 共识，所有写入先交给 Leader。","f":"6cebd291b8.mp3","h":"6cebd291b8","r":0},{"s":2,"a":5.4,"d":4.85,"text":"多数派确认才算提交，3 节点能容忍 1 个故障。","f":"631bee9ff0.mp3","h":"631bee9ff0","r":0},{"s":2,"a":10.6,"d":4.97,"text":"失去多数派，etcd 拒绝写入，期望状态被冻结。","f":"8589bb9272.mp3","h":"8589bb9272","r":0},{"s":3,"a":0.6,"d":4.54,"text":"组件之间不互相调用，只和 apiserver 打交道。","f":"783df13f8a.mp3","h":"783df13f8a","r":0},{"s":3,"a":5.8,"d":4.25,"text":"各自 watch 关心的对象，把自己那一步写回去。","f":"7d0ba740af.mp3","h":"7d0ba740af","r":0},{"s":3,"a":11.2,"d":4.78,"text":"同一个 Pod 被接力修改，resourceVersion 不断递增。","f":"affcbefe95.mp3","h":"affcbefe95","r":0},{"s":4,"a":0.6,"d":3.55,"text":"scheduler 只处理 nodeName 为空的 Pod。","f":"10a439c3ae.mp3","h":"10a439c3ae","r":0},{"s":4,"a":5.2,"d":4.97,"text":"Filter 排除放不下的节点，Score 再给剩下的打分。","f":"65c771b82b.mp3","h":"65c771b82b","r":0},{"s":4,"a":10.6,"d":4.37,"text":"选中后通过 Bind 写回 nodeName，调度完成。","f":"08fe2fad28.mp3","h":"08fe2fad28","r":0},{"s":5,"a":0.6,"d":4.01,"text":"kubelet 发现分给自己的 Pod，开始干活。","f":"fb05b65ab5.mp3","h":"fb05b65ab5","r":0},{"s":5,"a":5,"d":4.97,"text":"CSI 挂卷，CRI 建沙箱，再由 CNI 配 IP。","f":"e0853a227e.mp3","h":"e0853a227e","r":7},{"s":5,"a":10.2,"d":4.78,"text":"拉镜像、启动容器，把状态写回 apiserver。","f":"a4671d1525.mp3","h":"a4671d1525","r":0},{"s":6,"a":0.8,"d":4.37,"text":"小结：一个 Pod 的诞生，是多个组件的接力。","f":"8b40cfe765.mp3","h":"8b40cfe765","r":0},{"s":6,"a":5.6,"d":3.65,"text":"下一课，深入网络模型与 CNI。","f":"10938e8aec.mp3","h":"10938e8aec","r":0}]
